=\"color:#071c38;\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> for full details.\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:16px 32px 28px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#475569;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;\">We will contact you if we need any further information before your journey.</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0;\">Questions? Reply to this email, call <a href=\"tel:+442896022952\" style=\"color:#071c38;\">028 9602 2952</a>, WhatsApp <a href=\"https://wa.me/447549815538\" style=\"color:#071c38;\">07549 815538</a>, or email <a href=\"mailto:bookings@myairporttaxini.co.uk\" style=\"color:#071c38;\">bookings@myairporttaxini.co.uk</a>.</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#f8fafc;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:20px 32px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#64748b;\">\n              <strong style=\"color:#071c38;\">My Airport Taxi NI</strong><br />\n              <a href=\"https://www.myairporttaxini.co.uk\" style=\"color:#071c38;\">www.myairporttaxini.co.uk</a> ·\n              Call <a href=\"tel:+442896022952\" style=\"color:#071c38;\">028 9602 2952</a> ·\n              WhatsApp <a href=\"https://wa.me/447549815538\" style=\"color:#071c38;\">07549 815538</a> ·\n              <a href=\"mailto:bookings@myairporttaxini.co.uk\" style=\"color:#071c38;\">bookings@myairporttaxini.co.uk</a><br />\n              <a href=\"https://www.myairporttaxini.co.uk/terms/\" style=\"color:#071c38;\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> ·\n              <a href=\"https://www.myairporttaxini.co.uk/privacy/\" style=\"color:#071c38;\">Privacy Policy</a>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#071c38;padding:16px 32px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#94a3b8;\">\n              Premium airport transfers across Northern Ireland · Belfast · Dublin · Derry\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n    